[2.011, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nUser (1) 2026-09-06 12:00:45.799 UTC (+1.3s)\r\n\r\nExplain the placement named demo-all in namespace default: which clusters does it currently select, and why those? Keep \r\nit to a few lines.                                                                                                      \r\n"]
[2.259, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nTool (1) 2026-09-06 12:00:48.063 UTC (+3.5s) Success\r\n\r\nTool: mcp__ocm__list_placements\r\nArgs:\r\n- namespace: default\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nTool (2) 2026-09-06 12:00:48.064 UTC (+3.5s) Success\r\n\r\nTool: mcp__ocm__get_placement_decision\r\nArgs:\r\n- placement: demo-all\r\n- namespace: default\r\n"]
[5.980, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nAssistant (1) 2026-09-06 12:00:51.663 UTC (+7.1s)\r\n\r\nThe demo-all placement in default currently selects cluster1, cluster2, and cluster3 — all 3 clusters in the fleet.     \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\nHere's why:                                                                                                             \r\n- It draws from the global ManagedClusterSet, which by convention includes every managed cluster on the hub.            \r\n- It sets no numberOfClusters cap and has no label selectors or predicates, so it matches all clusters indiscriminate"]
[0.000, "o", "ly.\r\n- Its status confirms PlacementSatisfied: True and PlacementMisconfigured: False, meaning the scheduler found clusters  \r\n  to fill the request without any issues.                                                                               \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\nIn short, demo-all is an \"select everything\" placement — it exists to fan out workloads or policies to the entire fleet.\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nTask Summary\r\n\r\nTotal Cost:              0.065\r\nTotal Duration:          9.5s\r\n\r\n\r\nAssistant Messages:      1\r\nTool Calls:              2\r\nTask ID:                 6ee215d72b87fcd8eec44bc4ed3e2719\r\n"]
[0.426, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 6. ship a new service the LAZY way - the guardrails must refuse\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ bob -p \"Ship a new storefront service fast: propose deploying image nginx:latest to namespace shop on cl...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
