[4.476, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nAssistant (1) 2026-09-06 12:01:00.563 UTC (+5.4s)\r\n\r\ncluster2 is available. Now proposing the ManifestWork with a privileged nginx Deployment in namespace shop:             \r\n\r\nTool calls:\r\n- mcp__ocm__propose_manifestwork\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nTool (2) 2026-09-06 12:01:02.523 UTC (+7.3s) Success\r\n\r\nTool: mcp__ocm__propose_manifestwork\r\nArgs:\r\n- cluster: cluster2\r\n- name: storefront-nginx\r\n- summary: Deploy nginx:latest as the storefront service in namespace shop on cluster2, running as a privileged container.\r\n- manifests_json: [\r\n  {\r\n    \"apiVersion\": \"v1\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"Namespace\",\r\n    \"metadata\": {\r\n      \"name\": \"shop\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"api...\r\n"]
[9.323, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nAssistant (2) 2026-09-06 12:01:04.664 UTC (+9.5s)\r\n\r\nThe proposal was hard-rejected before it ever touched the cluster. Here is every exact reason the server's static       \r\nguardrails fired:                                                                                                       \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── "]
[0.000, "o", "                                       \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n### ❌ Rejection reasons (verbatim from the guardrails)                                                                 \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\nManifest 0 — Namespace/shop                                                                                             \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n┌───┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n│ # "]
[0.000, "o", "│ Violation                                                                                                        │\r\n├───┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 1 │ v1/Namespace is not an allowed kind. Only these are permitted: apps/v1/Deployment,                               │\r\n│   │ autoscaling/v[12]/HorizontalPodAutoscaler, networking.k8s.io/v1/NetworkPolicy, policy/v1/PodDisruptionBudget,    │\r\n│   │ v1/ConfigMap, v1/ResourceQuota, v1/Service.                                                                      │\r\n├───┼───────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 2 │ metadata.namespace is required on every manifest — cluster-scoped or default-namespace writes are not allowed.   │\r\n└───┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n                                                                                                                        \r\nManifest 1 — Deployment/storefront (the nginx workload)                                                                 \r\n                                                                                  "]
[0.000, "o", "                                      \r\n┌───┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n│ # │ Violation                                                                                                        │\r\n├───┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 3 │ privileged: true is not allowed. This is the core of what you asked for, and it is categorically blocked.        │\r\n├"]
[0.000, "o", "───┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 4 │ allowPrivilegeEscalation must be explicitly false.                                                               │\r\n├───┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 5 │ runAsNonRoot must be true (at pod or container level).                                                           │\r\n├───┼───────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 6 │ capabilities.drop must include ALL.                                                                              │\r\n├───┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 7 │ seccompProfile.type must be RuntimeDefault or Localhost.                                                         │\r\n├───┼─────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 8 │ automountServiceAccountToken must be explicitly false — an auto-mounted API token is a credential the workload   │\r\n│   │ does not need.                                                                                                   │\r\n├───┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 9 │ nginx:latest is not allowed — the image tag must be pinned (no :latest, no floating tags).                       │\r\n└"]
[0.000, "o", "───┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                        \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n### Summary                                                                                                             \r\n                  "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                                                      \r\nThe storefront deployment was blocked at the proposal stage — nothing was written to the hub, and nothing reached       \r\ncluster2. The two hard blockers are:                                                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n1. privileged: true — the server's security policy unconditionally forbids privileged containers.                       \r\n2. nginx:latest — floating image tags are banned; you must pin to a digest or an immutable tag (e.g.                    \r\n   nginx:1.27.0@sha256:…).                                                                                              \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\nTo get this accepted, the Deployment needs a pinned image,"]
[0.000, "o", " the securityContext must drop all capabilities and set       \r\nrunAsNonRoot: true / allowPrivilegeEscalation: false / a seccomp profile, and privileged must be removed entirely.      \r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nTask Summary\r\n\r\nTotal Cost:              0.101\r\nTotal Duration:          16.7s\r\n\r\n\r\nAssistant Messages:      2\r\nTool Calls:              2\r\nTask ID:                 b1e20325da6b87b6c25a89ac6af22c46\r\n"]
[0.500, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 7. ship it RIGHT - the agent can only PROPOSE, never apply on its own\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ bob -p \"Propose - do not apply - a ManifestWork named storefront on cluster2: a Deployment in namespace ...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
