[6.150, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nAssistant (1) 2026-09-06 12:01:22.189 UTC (+8.9s)\r\n\r\nThe guardrails gave precise feedback. Fixing all four issues — removing the cluster-scoped Namespace manifest, setting  \r\nautomountServiceAccountToken: false, and adding a RuntimeDefault seccomp profile — then re-proposing:                   \r\n\r\nTool calls:\r\n- mcp__ocm__propose_manifestwork\r\n"]
